ing legend of the seeker  spartacus reign and charmed most  recently parker appeared in a recurring  role in the free form show good trouble  playing pompous artist yuri elwyn  in a role that was mostly performed  through motion capture andy circus  didn't have a lot of screen time in the  lord of the rings however he still came  out of the experience as a household  name thanks to his brilliant portrayal  of the tragic and singularly focused  golem thanks to his nuanced and emotive  motion capture and voice performance  circus would go on to make a name for  himself as the go-to motion capture  performer in hollywood he later brought  to life characters such as the titular  ape and king kong supreme leader snoke  and star wars and caesar in the planet  of the apes films  but circus also continued to act on  screen as well appearing in a number of  well-received and highly publicized  films such as 13 going on 30 the  prestige and black panther along with  smaller titles that are less well known  circus also stepped behind the lens to  direct as a second unit director for the  hobbit trilogy which also saw him  reprise his role as gollum he went on to  direct several other feature films as  well including the recent dark superhero  flick venom let there be carnage  recently circus continues to dip his  toes into as many lucrative franchises  as possible he had his recent role as  alfred in the batman and has several  projects including film sequels original  films and a video game voiceover role  currently in the works  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

